Short:        Fade functions for fading colortables.
Author:       mad.nano@mailcity.com
Uploader:     mad nano mailcity com
Type:         dev/src
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

5 fade functions written in C for fading colortables same as for LoadRGB32().

    FadeBlack()
    FadeWhite()
    FadeCol2Col()
    FadeBlack2Col()
    FadeWhite2Col()
